sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as React app
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>UI: Open Schedule session
  UI->>API: GET /api/v1/mentors/{id}/availability (E21)
  API->>DB: SELECT open future slots
  API-->>UI: 200 slots
  S->>UI: Choose slot, mode, link, Confirm
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/mentorships/{id}/sessions (E34)
  API->>API: Verify JWT, student is party, mentorship active
  API->>DB: BEGIN
  API->>DB: INSERT session (slot_id, student_id, mentor_id, time range)
  alt unique slot or EXCLUDE constraint fires
    DB-->>API: constraint violation
    API->>DB: ROLLBACK
    API-->>UI: 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE or SESSION_CONFLICT
    UI-->>S: Error banner, reload slots
  else inserted
    API->>DB: INSERT notification for mentor
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 201 session
    UI-->>S: Toast, session in list
  end
